  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Pda 610) #8322, EXEMPT, eff 4-8-05; amd by #9050, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-08; amd by #12935, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-20; ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23; ss by #13829, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-24",
